<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Participants receive a temporary tactical simulation hediff, improving aiming speed, shooting accuracy, and movement speed. -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.description>参与者会获得一个临时的战术模拟状态，提高瞄准速度、射击精度和移动速度。</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.comps.0.label>参与者人数</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: confused -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>混乱</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was confused. The simulation was completed, but the tactical picture was muddled and hard to apply. -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}令人困惑。模拟虽然完成了，但战术态势含混不清，难以投入实战。</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: useful -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>有用</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was useful. Participants left with a clearer sense of fields of fire and fallback routes. -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}很有帮助。参与者对射界和撤退路线有了更清晰的认识。</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: precise -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>精确</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was precise. Participants coordinated target lanes, movement timings, and firing discipline. -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}相当精确。参与者协调了目标通道、机动时机和射击纪律。</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: brilliant -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>卓越</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was brilliant. The colony's defenders moved through the simulated battle plan with practiced confidence. -->
  <DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}堪称卓越。殖民地的防御者以训练有素的自信推进了整套模拟作战计划。</DNX_TacticalSimulationOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  
